Features of This Design
**Responsive Layout**
- Small Screens (320px to 768px): 2 products per row.
- Medium Screens (769px to 1200px): 3 products per row.
- Large Screens (>1200px): 4 products per row.
**Modern Look**
Each product card has a hover effect for better user interaction.
**Scalable Grid**
Uses CSS Grid with auto-fit and minmax to adapt seamlessly to screen size.
**Customizable**
Easy to extend for more products and styles.

